{"id":"word:hebrew:H5945","type":"word","title":"עֶלְיוֹן","subtitle":"H5945 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"an elevation , i.e. (adj.) lofty (compar.); as title, the Supreme","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to עֶלְיוֹן (H5945) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m a.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 53 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"עֶלְיוֹן (ʻelyôwn) means an elevation , i.e. (adj.) lofty (compar.); as title, the Supreme First listed occurrence: 1Chr 7 24."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"עֶלְיוֹן","transliteration":"ʻelyôwn","pronunciation":"el-yone'","strong":"H5945","lemmaId":"hebrew:H5945","partOfSpeech":"n-m a","forms":["עֶלְיֽוֹן","עֶלְי֔וֹן","הָֽ/עֶלְי֔וֹן","עֶ֝לְי֗וֹן","עֶלְי֑וֹן"],"morphs":[["HAamsa",32],["HTd/Aamsa",11],["HTd/Aafsa",4],["HR/Aamsa",3],["HC/Aamsa",2],["HTd/Aafpa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"an elevation , i.e. (adj.) lofty (compar.); as title, the Supreme","usage":"(Most, on) high(-er, -est), upper(-most).","full":"H5945. elyown I. עֶלְיוֺן 22 adjective 1 high ; — masculine singular ׳ע Deut 26:19 ; 28:1 ; 1Kin 9:8 (? reading הָע הַזֶּה ׳הַבַּיִת as ᵐ5 L Benz) = 2Chr 7:21 , of ׳י Psa 97:9 . 2 upper Bethhoron, ׳ע Josh 16:5 העליון 1Chr 7:24 ; 2Chr 8:5 , the upper (opposed to lower), of house Neh 3:25 ; compare 2Kin 15:35 ; 2Chr 23:20 5 t., + Gen 40:17 ( uppermost basket); feminine singular הָעֶלְיוֺנָה the upper pool 2Kin 18:17 = Isa 36:2 ; 7:3 ; the highest side-chamber ( צֵלָע ) Ezek 41:7 ; feminine plural הָעֶלְיוֺנֹת 42:5 the upper chambers ( לְשָׁכוֺת ). 3 of Davidic king exalted above monarchs Psa 89:28 (compare Deut 28:1 , above). II. עֶלְיוֺן noun masculine Highest, Most High (probably = foregoing); — 1 name of God Num 24:16 ; Deut 32:8 ; Psa 18:14 = 2Sam 22:14 ; Psa 9:3 ; 21:8 ; 46:5 ; 50:14 ; 73:11 ; 77:11 ; 78:17 ; Psalm 83:19; 87:5 ; 91:1 ; 91:9 ; 92:2 ; 107:11 ; Isa 14:14 ; Lam 3:35 , 38 ; with other divine names: עליון אל Gen 14:18-19 , 20 , 22 (see Di) Psa 78:35 ; עליון יהוה Psalm 7:18; 47:3 ; עליון אלהים 57:3 ; 78:56 . 5 of rulers, either monarchs or angel-princes , עֶלְיוֺן בְּנֵי = אלהים Psa 82:6 . [ עֶלְיוֺן ] adjective id. (Biblical Hebrew id. ); — plural of God, עֶלְיוֺנִין קַדִּישֵׁי (double plural, Buhl, as sometimes Biblical Hebrew, Ges § 124q Kö ii. 1. 438 f ) Dan 7:18 , 22 , 25 , 27 .","rootNote":"from 5927 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 7 24","keyReferences":["1Chr 7 24","1Kgs 9 8","2Chr 7 21","2Chr 8 5","2Chr 23 20","2Chr 27 3","2Chr 32 30","2Kgs 15 35"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":53,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 7 24","book":"1Chr","chapter":7,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָ/עֶלְי֑וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aamsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 9 8","book":"1Kgs","chapter":9,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֶלְי֔וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAamsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 7 21","book":"2Chr","chapter":7,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֶלְי֔וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HAamsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 8 5","book":"2Chr","chapter":8,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָֽ/עֶלְי֔וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aamsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 23 20","book":"2Chr","chapter":23,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָֽ/עֶלְי֖וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aamsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 27 3","book":"2Chr","chapter":27,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָ/עֶלְי֑וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aamsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 32 30","book":"2Chr","chapter":32,"verse":30,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָֽ/עֶלְי֔וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aamsa"},{"reference":"2Kgs 15 35","book":"2Kgs","chapter":15,"verse":35,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָ/עֶלְיֽוֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Aamsa"},{"reference":"2Kgs 18 17","book":"2Kgs","chapter":18,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sour